### Understanding Your Qualifications
To receive SSI or Social Security Disability Insurance, your application must meet very specific criteria regarding age, family status, income, citizenship, and disability determination. You cannot file online if you fall into any of these prohibited categories: [p261]

If you fit the following profile, you may be eligible to apply via the **Online SSI Application System**:
